{"Kafka test uses real confluent_kafka clients (AdminClient, Producer, Consumer) instead of required LocalProducer with MemoryMessageStorage testing utilities, violating testing pattern requirements": 0.3696092367172241, "FixedQueuePool.shutdown sets per-worker shutdown flag before initiating queue shutdown, causing workers to stop after current item and leave already-enqueued WorkItems unprocessed": 0.8356406688690186, "FixedQueuePool creates queue.Queue() without maxsize parameter, making queues unbounded and preventing backpressure when workers are slow, risking OOM despite docstring claiming 'Natural backpressure when queues fill up'": 0.9198469519615173, "In close(), commit thread is stopped before queue pool workers are shut down, causing items completed during shutdown to have offsets never committed, leading to message reprocessing on restart": 0.9517017006874084, "New processing mode thread-queue-parallel is introduced without feature-flag gating, preventing gradual rollout and rollback for experimental functionality": 0.20238830149173737, "OffsetTracker.get_committable_offsets linearly scans every integer between min and max seen offsets using range(start, max_offset + 1), causing O(max-min) loop with sparse offsets or large gaps": 0.5013175010681152, "join() delegates entirely to close() which calls queue_pool.shutdown(), causing double shutdown when arroyo calls both methods in sequence": 0.6673550009727478}